    </Text>
    <Text id="3" huntingZoneId="205" prevId="2" villagerId="2001">
        <Page social="4">[EN] Good skin! Thank you! &lt;NEXTPAGEBUTTON&gt;No problem.&lt;/NEXTPAGEBUTTON&gt;&lt;br&gt;[ES] &amp;#161;Buena piel! &amp;#161;Gracias! &lt;NEXTPAGEBUTTON&gt;No problem.&lt;/NEXTPAGEBUTTON&gt;</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="4" huntingZoneId="205" villagerId="2001">
        <Page social="0">[EN] Need toad skin!&lt;br&gt;[ES] &amp;#161;Necesitamos piel de sapo!</Page>
    </Text>
